# M2 LSU directed tests without golden checkpoints, pass/fail only: the LR/SC
# reservation loop (its SC outcomes depend on the microarchitecture), the
# non-cacheable access smoke test, and sc_wperm (an SC to a page it may not
# write faults with or without a reservation; the golden lets a failing SC
# skip the store permission check).
# Format: <suite>/<name> [budget=<cycles>] [hex=<path>] [tohost=<word index>]
lsu/lrsc_reorder hex=test/lrsc_reorder/lrsc_reorder.hex budget=100000
lsu/io_smoke hex=test/io_smoke/io_smoke.hex budget=100000
lsu/sc_wperm hex=test/directed/sc_wperm.hex budget=100000
